    "en": {
      "name": "Voidvelg Chrysaor",
      "effect": "Send the top 3 cards of your Deck to the Graveyard. If a DARK Attribute Galaxy Type monster is among the cards, this turn, this card can attack up to the number of DARK Attribute Galaxy Type monsters you sent to the Graveyard. If 3 DARK Attribute Galaxy Type monsters with the same Level were sent to the Graveyard by this effect, you can also destroy all face-up Level 8 or lower monsters on your opponent's field."
